<section class="section-block" id="recruitment">
  <h2>Postdoctoral and student opportunities</h2>
  <p>I welcome postdoctoral applications year-round and recruit 1–3 graduate students each year. The number of places at the master’s and doctoral levels has yet to be determined. Undergraduates are also welcome to join the group early in their studies and take part in research.</p>
  <p>To apply, email your CV, transcript and a research question that interests you to <a href="mailto:wangylin36@mail.sysu.edu.cn">wangylin36@mail.sysu.edu.cn</a>.</p>
</section>

